      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have not been able to reproduce this on the beta, I have tried adding a state that transitions to \"proxy_stand_still\" on both the main locomotion layer, and a separate layer on the locomotion animator, both work as expected.\nHave you configured your animator in some different way? Are anyone else experiencing this?",
      "viewerReactions": null
