      "value": "@{59a50e29df83a3566e6fb959|full_name}: I can confirm this behavior was happening on Sunday Community Meetup. I am using custom locomotion layer included in franada's Locomotion Master, which can be found in VRCPrefabs database, version 2.2.2.",
