      "statusChangeID": "609085a7a3151456dd9771c0",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "After further investigation, it appears that the timing on some avatar related calculations have changed, and \"TrackingType\" is incorrectly set to 2 for a few frames.\nThe animators in question appears to expect a very specific timing, and their states reach dead ends after load, which is something we would discourage. (The 3.0 documentation has been changed to reflect this)\nIn particular, these animators get stuck on the wrong \"TrackingType\" state, while the parameter itself ends up being correct, \"TrackingType\" may change for different reasons, if these animators supported the potential change of them, they would still work.\nThis will be reviewed further, but for the moment will release as is.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
