      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b12d42e9ad122540bc69858|full_name}: In particular, you can fix this controller by changing this transition to be false when TrackingType is 2-- right now, I think it includes 2 in its conditional. `TrackingType == 2 && VRMode == 1` is an invalid state and should be considered a \"the avatar isn't ready yet\" state.\nEither way, the animator should be designed to handle `TrackingType` changing to a different value after avatar init, otherwise us doing possible future things like enabling/disabling FBT or VR on the fly will break the avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
