      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just did test the new changes I made and fixed the issues of this controller. However: everything that changed from last patch to this one is, that for some reason the TrackingType Parameter jumps to two as mentioned in here already. When having FBT on and turning trackers off VRChat still stays at TrackingType 6 until I open the menu and that causes the avatar to reload - reinitializing the locomotion layer as well. Meaning the ability to shift \"TrackingTypes\" on the fly right now is purely to avoid the trackingtype = 2 flapping and has no other use as of now. Going from half body to full body (trackingtype 3 to 6) its the same. I have to manually press on calibrate to get trackingtype to change .\n(If the comment sounds harsh or too direct, its only meant to put as much info in here as possible.)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
